commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-06-10T10:13:55Z","label":{"name":"status: under investigation","color":"fbca04"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/comments/1585618245","html_url":"https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/10523#issuecomment-1585618245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/10523","id":1585618245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCl-cD85egp1F","user":{"login":"alexandresoro","id":8618767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTg3Njc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8618767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandresoro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-06-10T11:01:46Z","updated_at":"2023-06-10T11:03:07Z","body":"> > Click once again on 'update first name' -> no reset happens\r\n> \r\n> what do you mean by this? what's your expected behavior?\r\n\r\nHi, I've updated the code to make it more explicit.\r\nBasically, the buttons are there to simulate an external update of `values`.\r\nWhen `values` gets updated, it is expected that the form gets updated accordingly.\r\n\r\nWhen `values` is set to something that matches `defaultValues` and `keepDefaultValues` is `true`, I expected values and form state to be updated accordingly, which is not the case.\r\n\r\nSince it works fine when setting anything else than the `defaultsValues` or when `keepDefaultValues` is not `true`, I suspect the behavior is inconsistent, but can be explained by the code I linked in my initial comment.\r\n\r\nHope it clarifies the use case 🙂 \r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/comments/1585618245/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alexandresoro","id":8618767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTg3Njc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8618767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandresoro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandresoro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":9491854452,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOCl-cD85oXHInzwAAAAI1wjR0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/issues/events/9491854452","actor":{"login":"bluebill1049","id":10513364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTEzMzY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10513364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u